# Build context filter for images built from the repository root (api/Dockerfile).
# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include only what the images need. This guarantees that
# .env, study notes, .git and local node_modules are never sent to the Docker build.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!api/package.json
!api/src
!tools/receiver/package.json
